1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,780
Video ya leo ni nini? Hatua ya kwanza ya Kijapani.

2
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:09,780
Sehemu ya 1: Kujumuishana na Utangulizi wa Ofisi

3
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:12,049
Hajimemeshwa.

4
00:00:12,072 --> 00:00:14,948
Mimi ni Tanaka.

5
00:00:14,971 --> 00:00:16,805
Hajimemeshwa.

6
00:00:16,828 --> 00:00:19,642
Mimi ni Suzuki.

7
00:00:19,665 --> 00:00:23,432
Je, wewe ni mfanyakazi wa kampuni hii, Suzuki?

8
00:00:23,455 --> 00:00:25,096
Ndiyo.

9
00:00:25,119 --> 00:00:28,488
Kutoka leo, nitafanya kazi katika kampuni hii.

10
00:00:28,511 --> 00:00:31,678
Mimi pia ni mfanyakazi wa kampuni hii.

11
00:00:31,701 --> 00:00:35,501
Wewe ni msaidizi wa nani, Suzuki?

12
00:00:35,524 --> 00:00:39,357
Mimi ni msaidizi wa Sato.

13
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:42,514
Kiti cha Sato kiko wapi?

14
00:00:42,537 --> 00:00:46,503
Kiti cha Sato kiko huko.

15
00:00:46,526 --> 00:00:49,593
Ni kiti karibu na dirisha.

16
00:00:49,617 --> 00:00:51,225
Huko?

17
00:00:51,249 --> 00:00:53,264
Asante.

18
00:00:53,287 --> 00:00:56,360
Je, hii ni kadi ya biashara ya Tanaka?

19
00:00:56,384 --> 00:00:58,068
Ndiyo.

20
00:00:58,092 --> 00:01:01,132
Ndiyo, hiyo ni kadi yangu.

21
00:01:01,156 --> 00:01:03,006
Tafadhali, karibu.

22
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:04,866
Asante.

23
00:01:04,890 --> 00:01:07,856
Je, hii ni daftari lako, Tanaka?

24
00:01:07,879 --> 00:01:09,913
Hapana.

25
00:01:09,936 --> 00:01:13,275
Hiyo si daftari langu.

26
00:01:13,298 --> 00:01:15,764
Je, ni daftari lako, Suzuki?

27
00:01:15,787 --> 00:01:17,287
Ndiyo.

28
00:01:17,311 --> 00:01:19,117
Hii ndiyo.

29
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:22,382
Hii ni daftari langu.

30
00:01:22,406 --> 00:01:25,825
Je, daftari la ukaguzi pia ni lako, Suzuki?

31
00:01:25,848 --> 00:01:27,915
Hapana.

32
00:01:27,938 --> 00:01:30,983
Daftari la ukaguzi ni la Sato.

33
00:01:31,006 --> 00:01:32,866
Nimeelewa.

34
00:01:32,889 --> 00:01:36,089
Una umri gani, Suzuki?

35
00:01:36,113 --> 00:01:39,146
Mimi nina miaka ishirini na tano.

36
00:01:39,169 --> 00:01:42,202
Je, wewe pia una miaka ishirini na tano, Tanaka?

37
00:01:42,225 --> 00:01:44,159
Hapana.

38
00:01:44,182 --> 00:01:46,982
Mimi nina miaka ishirini na nane.

39
00:01:47,005 --> 00:01:49,538
Basi, wewe ni mkuu wangu.

40
00:01:49,561 --> 00:01:52,795
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

41
00:01:52,819 --> 00:01:55,752
Kompyuta yako ni ipi, Suzuki?

42
00:01:55,775 --> 00:01:59,242
Kompyuta yangu ni hii.

43
00:01:59,265 --> 00:02:02,637
Kiti chako kiko hapa.

44
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:04,502
Tafadhali, karibu.

45
00:02:04,525 --> 00:02:05,692
Ndiyo.

46
00:02:05,715 --> 00:02:08,248
Asante.

47
00:02:08,271 --> 00:02:15,376
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua tena video ya leo kipo kwenye sehemu ya maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

48
00:02:15,376 --> 00:02:18,376
Sehemu ya 2: Umiliki na Uanachama: Vitabu na Daftari

49
00:02:18,376 --> 00:02:22,752
Suzuki, hicho ni kitabu cha nini?

50
00:02:22,776 --> 00:02:24,543
Hiki?

51
00:02:24,566 --> 00:02:28,345
Hiki ni kitabu cha Kijapani.

52
00:02:28,369 --> 00:02:31,102
Kitabu hicho ni cha nani?

53
00:02:31,125 --> 00:02:33,740
Je, ni kitabu chako, Suzuki?

54
00:02:33,763 --> 00:02:38,411
Hapana, hiki si kitabu changu.

55
00:02:38,435 --> 00:02:40,614
Ni kitabu cha maktaba.

56
00:02:40,637 --> 00:02:43,071
Kitabu cha maktaba?

57
00:02:43,094 --> 00:02:44,960
Ndiyo.

58
00:02:44,983 --> 00:02:48,183
Daftari lako ni lipi, Tanaka?

59
00:02:48,206 --> 00:02:51,478
Daftari langu ni hili.

60
00:02:51,501 --> 00:02:54,337
Ni daftari la buluu hili.

61
00:02:54,361 --> 00:02:57,694
Hiyo kalamu pia ni ya Bwana Tanaka?

62
00:02:57,717 --> 00:02:58,795
Ndiyo.

63
00:02:58,819 --> 00:03:01,985
Hii kalamu pia ni yangu.

64
00:03:02,008 --> 00:03:04,654
Kalamu ya Bibi Suzuki iko wapi?

65
00:03:04,678 --> 00:03:08,377
Kalamu yangu iko huko.

66
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,417
Iko juu ya kamusi.

67
00:03:10,441 --> 00:03:12,850
Aa, hapa ndiyo.

68
00:03:12,874 --> 00:03:16,274
Hii ni kamusi ya Kiingereza?

69
00:03:16,297 --> 00:03:18,578
Je, ni kamusi ya Kijapani?

70
00:03:18,601 --> 00:03:21,734
Hiyo ni kamusi ya Kijapani.

71
00:03:21,757 --> 00:03:24,558
Kamusi hii inagharimu pesa ngapi?

72
00:03:24,582 --> 00:03:28,277
Kamusi hiyo inagharimu elfu tatu.

73
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:30,974
Elfu tatu?

74
00:03:30,998 --> 00:03:33,080
Kile ni nini?

75
00:03:33,103 --> 00:03:36,397
Kitu kilicho juu ya meza ile.

76
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:39,220
Kile ni saa.

77
00:03:39,243 --> 00:03:41,936
Ni saa ya Bwana Sato.

78
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:46,207
Je, saa ile pia ni mali ya shule ya Kijapani?

79
00:03:46,230 --> 00:03:51,235
Hapana, saa ile si mali ya shule.

80
00:03:51,259 --> 00:03:53,592
Ni mali ya Bwana Sato.

81
00:03:53,615 --> 00:03:55,381
Nimeelewa.

82
00:03:55,404 --> 00:03:58,581
Ufunguo wa chumba hiki uko wapi?

83
00:03:58,605 --> 00:04:01,844
Ufunguo wa chumba uko hapa.

84
00:04:01,868 --> 00:04:04,148
Uko ndani ya dawati.

85
00:04:04,172 --> 00:04:06,538
Nimeelewa.

86
00:04:06,561 --> 00:04:08,695
Asante.

87
00:04:08,718 --> 00:04:17,263
Kama umesikia, tafadhali uandike maoni.

88
00:04:17,263 --> 00:04:20,263
Sehemu ya 3: Mwongozo wa Kituo cha Gari la Moshi na Ununuzi wa Tiketi

89
00:04:20,263 --> 00:04:21,917
Samahani.

90
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:24,794
Choo cha kituo cha gari la moshi kiko wapi?

91
00:04:24,818 --> 00:04:28,106
Choo kiko pale.

92
00:04:28,130 --> 00:04:30,896
Karibu na duka la bidhaa.

93
00:04:30,919 --> 00:04:32,930
Pale ndiyo.

94
00:04:32,954 --> 00:04:35,287
Asante.

95
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:38,477
Mahali pa kununua tiketi kiko wapi?

96
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:42,079
Mahali pa kununua tiketi kiko hapa.

97
00:04:42,103 --> 00:04:44,281
Ni dirisha hili.

98
00:04:44,304 --> 00:04:46,671
Hapa ndiyo?

99
00:04:46,694 --> 00:04:50,060
Tiketi ya Tokyo inagharimu pesa ngapi?

100
00:04:50,083 --> 00:04:53,850
Tiketi ya Tokyo inagharimu shilingi mia sita.

101
00:04:53,873 --> 00:04:57,406
Shilingi mia sita?

102
00:04:57,429 --> 00:05:01,196
Je, tiketi ya Bibi Suzuki pia ni shilingi mia sita?

103
00:05:01,219 --> 00:05:06,598
Hapana, tiketi yangu si shilingi mia sita.

104
00:05:06,621 --> 00:05:09,188
Ni shilingi mia tisa.

105
00:05:09,211 --> 00:05:11,144
Nimeelewa.

106
00:05:11,167 --> 00:05:14,051
Ofisi ya mwongozo iko wapi?

107
00:05:14,075 --> 00:05:16,875
Ofisi ya mwongozo iko upande ule.

108
00:05:16,898 --> 00:05:19,745
Karibu na mlango wa kusini.

109
00:05:19,768 --> 00:05:22,041
Upande ule ndiyo.

110
00:05:22,065 --> 00:05:25,081
Jengo lile ni nini?

111
00:05:25,104 --> 00:05:28,386
Lile ni hoteli ya kituo cha gari la moshi.

112
00:05:28,410 --> 00:05:33,143
Je, hoteli ile ni ya kampuni ya Kijapani?

113
00:05:33,166 --> 00:05:37,566
Ndiyo, ni ya kampuni ya Kijapani.

114
00:05:37,589 --> 00:05:40,522
Kampuni ya Bibi Suzuki iko wapi?

115
00:05:40,545 --> 00:05:43,779
Kampuni yangu iko hapa.

116
00:05:43,802 --> 00:05:45,768
Ndani ya kituo cha treni.

117
00:05:45,791 --> 00:05:48,438
Ndani ya kituo cha treni?

118
00:05:48,462 --> 00:05:50,462
Ni rahisi sana!

119
00:05:50,485 --> 00:05:54,091
Ndiyo, ni rahisi sana.

120
00:05:54,115 --> 00:05:57,081
Shule ya Tanaka iko wapi?

121
00:05:57,104 --> 00:06:00,038
Shule yangu iko pale.

122
00:06:00,061 --> 00:06:03,479
Iko ghorofa ya tatu ya jengo lile.

123
00:06:03,502 --> 00:06:05,998
Aa, jengo lile, ndiyo.

124
00:06:06,021 --> 00:06:08,421
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

125
00:06:08,444 --> 00:06:11,444
Sehemu ya 4: Mkutano na Ratiba ya Kazi / Mkutano na Ratiba ya Kazi

126
00:06:11,444 --> 00:06:16,778
Suzuki, mkutano wa kesho unaanza saa ngapi?

127
00:06:16,801 --> 00:06:22,267
Mkutano wa kesho unaanza saa nne asubuhi hadi saa sita mchana.

128
00:06:22,290 --> 00:06:24,372
Saa nne asubuhi, ndiyo.

129
00:06:24,396 --> 00:06:26,997
Iko wapi mahali pake?

130
00:06:27,020 --> 00:06:30,786
Chumba cha mkutano kiko ghorofa ya tatu.

131
00:06:30,809 --> 00:06:35,043
Kuna hati nyingi juu ya meza.

132
00:06:35,066 --> 00:06:36,755
Asante.

133
00:06:36,778 --> 00:06:40,464
Leo mchana una kazi?

134
00:06:40,488 --> 00:06:46,154
Ndiyo, leo mchana nitafanya kazi kutoka saa saba asubuhi hadi saa kumi na moja mchana.

135
00:06:46,177 --> 00:06:51,511
Kila siku unafanya kazi kwa saa ngapi?

136
00:06:51,534 --> 00:06:54,667
Kila siku ninafanya kazi kwa saa nane.

137
00:06:54,690 --> 00:06:59,123
Jana Tanaka alifanya kazi hadi saa ngapi?

138
00:06:59,147 --> 00:07:03,834
Jana nilifanya kazi hadi saa tatu usiku.

139
00:07:03,857 --> 00:07:06,277
Hadi saa tatu usiku?

140
00:07:06,300 --> 00:07:08,379
Ilikuwa ngumu sana!

141
00:07:08,403 --> 00:07:13,403
Ndiyo. Lakini leo usiku sitafanya kazi.

142
00:07:13,426 --> 00:07:16,633
Leo usiku utapumzika?

143
00:07:16,656 --> 00:07:19,889
Ndiyo, nitapumzika.

144
00:07:19,912 --> 00:07:25,205
Suzuki, leo usiku tutaonana kula chakula pamoja?

145
00:07:25,229 --> 00:07:27,029
Sawa sana!

146
00:07:27,052 --> 00:07:29,462
Tutakula wapi?

147
00:07:29,486 --> 00:07:32,886
Tutakula mgahawa mbele ya kituo cha treni.

148
00:07:32,909 --> 00:07:35,743
Tutakwenda mgahawa saa ngapi?

149
00:07:35,767 --> 00:07:38,200
Tutakwenda saa moja usiku.

150
00:07:38,223 --> 00:07:40,708
Tutakwenda kwa gari?

151
00:07:40,731 --> 00:07:43,665
Hapana, tutakwenda kwa treni.

152
00:07:43,688 --> 00:07:45,526
Nimeelewa.

153
00:07:45,549 --> 00:07:49,282
Basi, tutaonana saa moja usiku mbele ya mgahawa.

154
00:07:49,305 --> 00:07:51,958
Ndiyo, tutaonana usiku.

155
00:07:51,981 --> 00:07:54,981
Sehemu ya 5: Twende Madukani / Twende Madukani

156
00:07:54,981 --> 00:07:59,070
Suzuki, kesho ni siku gani?

157
00:07:59,094 --> 00:08:03,148
Kesho ni Jumamosi.

158
00:08:03,171 --> 00:08:06,374
Aa, Jumamosi?

159
00:08:06,398 --> 00:08:10,249
Duka la maduka linafunguliwa saa ngapi?

160
00:08:10,272 --> 00:08:15,272
Duka la maduka linafunguliwa saa nne asubuhi.

161
00:08:15,295 --> 00:08:18,462
Hadi saa mbili usiku.

162
00:08:18,485 --> 00:08:21,365
Saa nne asubuhi, ndiyo.

163
00:08:21,389 --> 00:08:26,271
Kuna duka la mifuko ndani ya duka la maduka?

164
00:08:26,294 --> 00:08:32,752
Ndiyo, ghorofa ya pili kuna maduka mengi ya mifuko.

165
00:08:32,776 --> 00:08:37,176
Kuna maduka ya nguo na viatu pia.

166
00:08:37,199 --> 00:08:39,418
Sawa sana!

167
00:08:39,441 --> 00:08:44,487
Kesho asubuhi twende duka la maduka?

168
00:08:44,511 --> 00:08:46,522
Sawa sana!

169
00:08:46,545 --> 00:08:49,278
Twende pamoja!

170
00:08:49,301 --> 00:08:51,834
Tutaonana saa ngapi?

171
00:08:51,857 --> 00:08:57,116
Tutaonana saa nne kasoro dakika kumi na tisa asubuhi kwenye kituo cha treni.

172
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:59,873
Saa tisa na hamsini dakika.

173
00:08:59,896 --> 00:09:03,429
Kwa nini tunakwenda madukani?

174
00:09:03,452 --> 00:09:06,452
Twendeni kwa basi.

175
00:09:06,475 --> 00:09:10,114
Kituo cha basi kipo mbele ya stesheni.

176
00:09:10,137 --> 00:09:12,108
Nimeelewa.

177
00:09:12,132 --> 00:09:17,132
Jana ulienda ununua bidhaa wapi, UI?

178
00:09:17,155 --> 00:09:23,189
Jana nilinunua mboga na matunda katika duka la supamaketi.

179
00:09:23,213 --> 00:09:27,379
Bwana Suzuki, jana ulinunua nini?

180
00:09:27,402 --> 00:09:31,890
Mimi sikununua chochote jana.

181
00:09:31,913 --> 00:09:34,317
Nimeelewa.

182
00:09:34,341 --> 00:09:38,875
Basi, kesho tununue sana.

183
00:09:38,898 --> 00:09:40,737
Ndiyo.

184
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:45,194
Kesho tutaenda ununua kwa saa moja?

185
00:09:45,217 --> 00:09:50,383
Hapana, tutaenda ununua kwa saa tatu hivi.

186
00:09:50,406 --> 00:09:52,659
Saa tatu?

187
00:09:52,683 --> 00:09:55,883
Tutakwenda kwa miguu sana, eh?

188
00:09:55,906 --> 00:09:59,473
Ndiyo, twende kwa miguu.

189
00:09:59,496 --> 00:10:02,496
Sehemu ya 6: Mazungumzo Kuhusu Masomo na Mtihani

190
00:10:02,496 --> 00:10:07,948
Bwana Suzuki, jana usiku uliwasoma?

191
00:10:07,972 --> 00:10:14,984
Ndiyo, jana usiku niliwasoma Kijapani kwa saa mbili.

192
00:10:15,007 --> 00:10:18,974
Bibi Tanaka, uliwasoma kwa saa ngapi?

193
00:10:18,997 --> 00:10:25,230
Mimi sikwasoma kabisa jana usiku.

194
00:10:25,253 --> 00:10:27,943
Ni hivyo?

195
00:10:27,966 --> 00:10:31,533
Jana mtihani ulikuaje?

196
00:10:31,556 --> 00:10:35,156
Mtihani ulikuwa anza saa nne.

197
00:10:35,179 --> 00:10:40,413
Je, kulikuwa na saa katika darasa la mtihani?

198
00:10:40,436 --> 00:10:46,070
Hapana, hakukuwa na saa katika darasa.

199
00:10:46,093 --> 00:10:50,026
Ni hivyo? Ilikuwa vigumu, sivyo?

200
00:10:50,049 --> 00:10:54,735
Je, leo mchana tutasoma katika maktaba?

201
00:10:54,759 --> 00:10:57,492
Leo mchana?

202
00:10:57,515 --> 00:11:01,682
Nitakuwa maktaba kutoka saa saba mpaka saa kumi.

203
00:11:01,705 --> 00:11:04,518
Tusome pamoja.

204
00:11:04,541 --> 00:11:08,954
Je, kuna kamusi ndani ya maktaba?

205
00:11:08,977 --> 00:11:15,822
Ndiyo, kuna kamusi nyingi za Kijapani mezani.

206
00:11:15,846 --> 00:11:18,180
Je, kuna kompyuta pia?

207
00:11:18,203 --> 00:11:22,536
Ndiyo, kuna kompyuta tano pia.

208
00:11:22,559 --> 00:11:24,611
Sawa sana!

209
00:11:24,635 --> 00:11:27,677
Tutakwenda maktaba kwa njia gani?

210
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:30,519
Nitakwenda kwa baiskeli.

211
00:11:30,542 --> 00:11:34,009
Bwana Suzuki, utakwenda kwa njia gani?

212
00:11:34,032 --> 00:11:38,565
Mimi nitakwenda kwa gari na rafiki.

213
00:11:38,588 --> 00:11:40,722
Nimeelewa.

214
00:11:40,745 --> 00:11:45,011
Basi, tutaonana saa saba katika maktaba.

215
00:11:45,034 --> 00:11:48,077
Sawa, tutaonana baadaye.

216
00:11:48,101 --> 00:11:51,101
Sehemu ya 7: Mwisho wa Kazi na Mipango ya Wikiendi

217
00:11:51,101 --> 00:11:54,793
Bwana Suzuki, leo ni jioni ya Ijumaa.

218
00:11:54,817 --> 00:11:58,817
Leo utakwisha na kazi saa ngapi?

219
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:02,378
Leo nitakwisha saa kumi na mbili.

220
00:12:02,401 --> 00:12:06,835
Bibi Tanaka, utafanya kazi mpaka saa ngapi?

221
00:12:06,858 --> 00:12:11,338
Mimi nitafanya kazi mpaka saa kumi na moja na nusu.

222
00:12:11,362 --> 00:12:14,928
Utakwisha saa kumi na moja na nusu, eh?

223
00:12:14,951 --> 00:12:16,487
Ndiyo.

224
00:12:16,511 --> 00:12:21,160
Wiki hii kila siku tumefanya kazi nyingi.

225
00:12:21,183 --> 00:12:23,350
Nimeelewa.

226
00:12:23,373 --> 00:12:25,606
Asante kwa kazi ngumu.

227
00:12:25,629 --> 00:12:30,196
Je, una mipango gani ya Jumamosi na Jumapili?

228
00:12:30,219 --> 00:12:34,253
Jumamosi asubuhi nitaamka saa tatu.

229
00:12:34,276 --> 00:12:38,154
Kisha nitakwenda bustanini na marafiki.

230
00:12:38,177 --> 00:12:41,178
Mtafanya nini bustanini?

231
00:12:41,202 --> 00:12:44,180
Tutacheza tenisi bustanini.

232
00:12:44,203 --> 00:12:48,536
Bwana Suzuki, je, unacheza tenisi mwishoni mwa wiki?

233
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:53,326
Hapana, sifanyi tenisi kabisa.

234
00:12:53,349 --> 00:12:56,949
Nitatazama filamu Jumapili.

235
00:12:56,972 --> 00:12:59,805
Utaizama filamu wapi?

236
00:12:59,828 --> 00:13:03,462
Nitaizama katika sinema ya Shibuya.

237
00:13:03,485 --> 00:13:08,652
Bwana Tanaka, je, tutaweza kutazama filamu pamoja Jumamosi usiku?

238
00:13:08,675 --> 00:13:11,209
Jumamosi usiku?

239
00:13:11,232 --> 00:13:13,119
Sawa sana!

240
00:13:13,142 --> 00:13:15,549
Filamu itaanza saa ngapi?

241
00:13:15,572 --> 00:13:19,041
Filamu itaanza saa moja usiku.

242
00:13:19,065 --> 00:13:21,702
Itaendelea kuanzia saa moja hadi saa tatu usiku.

243
00:13:21,725 --> 00:13:23,692
Nimeelewa.

244
00:13:23,715 --> 00:13:29,315
Basi, tutaonana mbele ya sinema saa kumi na nusu mchana (6:30).

245
00:13:29,338 --> 00:13:30,988
Ndiyo.

246
00:13:31,012 --> 00:13:33,179
Utaenda kwa treni?

247
00:13:33,202 --> 00:13:34,735
Ndiyo.

248
00:13:34,758 --> 00:13:36,691
Nitaenda kwa reli ya chini ya ardhi.

249
00:13:36,714 --> 00:13:38,997
Nimeelewa.

250
00:13:39,020 --> 00:13:41,233
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

251
00:13:41,257 --> 00:13:44,257
Sehemu ya 8: Mipango ya Ununuzaji

252
00:13:44,257 --> 00:13:50,350
Bwana Suzuki, je, utaenda sokoni leo jioni?

253
00:13:50,373 --> 00:13:54,459
Ndiyo, nitaenda sokoni saa kumi na moja mchana (5:00).

254
00:13:54,483 --> 00:13:57,250
Bwana Tanaka, je, utaenda pia?

255
00:13:57,273 --> 00:14:00,888
Ndiyo, nitaenda saa kumi na moja mchana (5:00) pia.

256
00:14:00,912 --> 00:14:03,482
Je, tutaenda pamoja?

257
00:14:03,506 --> 00:14:05,340
Sawa sana!

258
00:14:05,363 --> 00:14:07,736
Twende pamoja!

259
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:10,846
Utanunua nini sokoni?

260
00:14:10,869 --> 00:14:13,902
Nitanunua nyama na samaki.

261
00:14:13,925 --> 00:14:17,259
Haya ni kwa ajili ya mapishi ya leo usiku.

262
00:14:17,282 --> 00:14:20,682
Sehemu ya nyama iko wapi?

263
00:14:20,705 --> 00:14:25,582
Sehemu ya nyama iko karibu na ingilio.

264
00:14:25,605 --> 00:14:29,018
Sehemu ya samaki iko ndani kabisa.

265
00:14:29,042 --> 00:14:30,893
Nimeelewa.

266
00:14:30,916 --> 00:14:33,883
Je, kuna mboga nyingi pia?

267
00:14:33,906 --> 00:14:37,676
Ndiyo, kuna mboga nyingi pia.

268
00:14:37,700 --> 00:14:40,733
Jana nilinunua nyanya.

269
00:14:40,756 --> 00:14:43,454
Nyanya zilikuwa bei gani?

270
00:14:43,477 --> 00:14:47,077
Nyanya moja ilikuwa shilingi mia moja.

271
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:49,634
Shilingi mia moja?

272
00:14:49,657 --> 00:14:51,665
Leo tutanunue tena.

273
00:14:51,688 --> 00:14:56,463
Sawa. Baada ya ununuzaji, tutaenda wapi?

274
00:14:56,486 --> 00:15:01,519
Baada ya ununuzaji, je, tutaweza kwenda nyumbani kwangu?

275
00:15:01,542 --> 00:15:03,742
Nyumbani kwako, Bwana Tanaka?

276
00:15:03,765 --> 00:15:05,462
Ni sawa?

277
00:15:05,486 --> 00:15:09,419
Ndiyo, tutapika pamoja.

278
00:15:09,442 --> 00:15:11,008
Sawa sana!

279
00:15:11,031 --> 00:15:13,643
Tutapika kwa muda gani?

280
00:15:13,667 --> 00:15:16,685
Tutapika kwa saa moja hivi.

281
00:15:16,709 --> 00:15:18,353
Nimeelewa.

282
00:15:18,376 --> 00:15:22,376
Basi, tutaonana saa kumi na moja mchana (5:00) kwenye ingilio la soko.

283
00:15:22,399 --> 00:15:24,613
Sawa, saa kumi na moja mchana (5:00).

284
00:15:24,637 --> 00:15:27,637
Sehemu ya 9: Kuingia Kwenye Hoteli

285
00:15:27,637 --> 00:15:29,503
Samahani.

286
00:15:29,526 --> 00:15:32,560
Ningependa kuingia.

287
00:15:32,583 --> 00:15:33,949
Ndiyo.

288
00:15:33,972 --> 00:15:36,906
Tafadhali nipe jina lako.

289
00:15:36,928 --> 00:15:39,107
Ninaitwa Tanaka.

290
00:15:39,131 --> 00:15:42,864
Nitakaa hapa kuanzia leo hadi Jumapili.

291
00:15:42,887 --> 00:15:45,287
Bwana Tanaka, ndiyo?

292
00:15:45,310 --> 00:15:48,277
Kutoka leo utakaa kwa usiku mbili, ndiyo?

293
00:15:48,300 --> 00:15:51,358
Chumba chako kiko ghorofa ya tano.

294
00:15:51,381 --> 00:15:53,834
Ghorofa ya tano, sawa.

295
00:15:53,858 --> 00:15:56,891
Lifti iko wapi?

296
00:15:56,914 --> 00:16:00,164
Lifti iko upande ule.

297
00:16:00,187 --> 00:16:02,521
Karibu na sebuleni.

298
00:16:02,544 --> 00:16:04,552
Nimeelewa.

299
00:16:04,575 --> 00:16:08,175
Kifungua kinywa huwa saa ngapi hadi saa ngapi?

300
00:16:08,198 --> 00:16:14,132
Kifungua kinywa huwa kuanzia saa moja asubuhi hadi saa tatu na nusu asubuhi.

301
00:16:14,155 --> 00:16:16,790
Huli chakula katika mgahawa wa ghorofa ya kwanza.

302
00:16:16,814 --> 00:16:19,447
Mgahawa wa ghorofa ya kwanza, sawa.

303
00:16:19,470 --> 00:16:23,270
Kuna chai ndani ya chumba?

304
00:16:23,293 --> 00:16:24,926
Ndiyo.

305
00:16:24,949 --> 00:16:28,727
Kuna chai na glasi mezani.

306
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:32,205
Kuna maji ndani ya friji pia.

307
00:16:32,229 --> 00:16:34,429
Kuna mengi?

308
00:16:34,452 --> 00:16:37,028
Kuna chupa mbili za maji.

309
00:16:37,052 --> 00:16:39,018
Nimeelewa.

310
00:16:39,041 --> 00:16:42,537
Kuna benki karibu na hoteli?

311
00:16:42,561 --> 00:16:43,899
Ndiyo.

312
00:16:43,923 --> 00:16:47,217
Kuna benki mbele ya hoteli.

313
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:51,444
Kuna posta karibu na benki pia.

314
00:16:51,468 --> 00:16:55,068
Ninaenda jinsi gani kwenye makumbusho ya sanaa karibu?

315
00:16:55,091 --> 00:16:58,224
Unaweza kwenda kwa basi kwenye makumbusho ya sanaa.

316
00:16:58,247 --> 00:17:01,480
Kituo cha basi kiko upande wa kulia wa hoteli.

317
00:17:01,503 --> 00:17:03,479
Basi, sawa.

318
00:17:03,502 --> 00:17:05,114
Asante.

319
00:17:05,138 --> 00:17:08,071
Sasa nitaenda chumbani.

320
00:17:08,094 --> 00:17:09,627
Ndiyo.

321
00:17:09,650 --> 00:17:11,696
Karibu, pumzika kwa utulivu.

322
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:14,720
Sehemu ya 10: Mwongozo wa Matumizi ya Gym

323
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:20,520
Hujambo. Nimeanza kutumia gym hii leo.

324
00:17:20,543 --> 00:17:24,318
Hujambo. Mimi ni Suzuki, msimamizi wa mapokezi.

325
00:17:24,341 --> 00:17:26,541
Nakutakia kazi njema.

326
00:17:26,564 --> 00:17:28,771
Nakutakia kazi njema.

327
00:17:28,794 --> 00:17:32,331
Gym inafunguliwa saa ngapi?

328
00:17:32,355 --> 00:17:37,854
Siku za wiki inafunguliwa kuanzia saa tatu asubuhi hadi saa nne usiku.

329
00:17:37,877 --> 00:17:43,843
Jumamosi na Jumapili inafunguliwa kuanzia saa nne asubuhi hadi saa mbili usiku.

330
00:17:43,866 --> 00:17:46,441
Inafunguliwa kila siku?

331
00:17:46,465 --> 00:17:50,479
Hapana, Jumapili inafungwa.

332
00:17:50,502 --> 00:17:52,636
Tunapumzika Jumapili.

333
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:55,271
Jumapili ndiyo siku ya kupumzika, sawa.

334
00:17:55,295 --> 00:17:57,331
Nimeelewa.

335
00:17:57,354 --> 00:18:00,488
Chumba cha kubadilisha nguo kiko wapi?

336
00:18:00,511 --> 00:18:03,577
Chumba cha lockers kiko ghorofa ya pili.

337
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:06,648
Bafu pia iko ghorofa ya pili.

338
00:18:06,672 --> 00:18:09,238
Ghorofa ya pili, sawa.

339
00:18:09,261 --> 00:18:12,028
Mahali pa kuweka viatu kiko wapi?

340
00:18:12,051 --> 00:18:16,121
Mahali pa kuweka viatu kiko karibu na ingresso ya ghorofa ya kwanza.

341
00:18:16,145 --> 00:18:18,921
Hapa ndipo panapohitajika kuvua viatu.

342
00:18:18,944 --> 00:18:20,959
Hapa, sawa.

343
00:18:20,983 --> 00:18:24,600
Leo nitazungumza kwa saa moja.

344
00:18:24,623 --> 00:18:26,390
Sawa sana!

345
00:18:26,413 --> 00:18:29,446
Jana ulikuwa unazungumza?

346
00:18:29,469 --> 00:18:34,203
Hapana, jana nilikuwa nyumbani nikitazama televisheni.

347
00:18:34,226 --> 00:18:37,438
Sikuwa nazungumza kabisa.

348
00:18:37,462 --> 00:18:39,395
Ni hivyo?

349
00:18:39,418 --> 00:18:41,785
Kutoka leo tutajitahidi.

350
00:18:41,808 --> 00:18:44,654
Ndiyo, tutajitahidi.

351
00:18:44,677 --> 00:18:50,173
Je, kuna mashine ya kununulia vinywaji ndani ya jimu?

352
00:18:50,196 --> 00:18:53,674
Ndiyo, iko karibu na eneo la ukaguzi.

353
00:18:53,697 --> 00:18:56,778
Kuna maji na chai kwa wingi!

354
00:18:56,802 --> 00:18:59,136
Nimeelewa.

355
00:18:59,158 --> 00:19:01,841
Basi, nitaenda ghorofa ya pili.

356
00:19:01,865 --> 00:19:04,484
Sawa, pole na safari njema!